  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1803.06 Applicant with Out of State Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1803.06 Applicant with Out of State Address. An application for a commercial driver license that does not bear a legal address within the state of New Hampshire shall be rejected and returned to the applicant, pursuant to Saf-C 1803.07, for the applicant to prove that they are a resident of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #4901, eff 8-3-90; ss by #6298, INTERIM, eff 8-3-96, EXPIRES: 12-1-96; ss by #6338, eff 9-25-96; ss by #8182, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRED: 3-24-05\n\nNew. #8405, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34 (formerly Saf-C 1803.07)",
